        {
          "id": "s2",
          "text": "Add garlic and spices and cook an additional minute.",
          "ingredientRefs": []
        },
        {
          "id": "s3",
          "text": "Pour the can of {i8} and juice into the pan and break down the tomatoes using a large spoon. Season with salt and pepper and bring the sauce to a simmer.",
          "ingredientRefs": [
            "i8"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "s4",
          "text": "Use your large spoon to make small wells in the sauce and crack {i9} into each well. Cook the eggs for 5 to 8 minutes, or until the eggs are done to your liking. You can also cover the pan with a lid to expedite the eggs cooking.",
